### ====================================================================
### medical-record-service - Node.js + Express + MongoDB Atlas
### database: medflow_medical_records (collections medical_records and encounters)
###
### THE PROJECT'S NON-RELATIONAL DATABASE. Every call goes through the gateway.
### ====================================================================

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@mr = {{gateway}}/api/medical-records

### Service health (same shape as the Spring services)
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### MEDICAL RECORDS (1 document per patient, with embedded arrays)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Paginated list (reduced projection)
GET {{mr}}/patients?page=0&size=10

### Filters on embedded fields and arrays
GET {{mr}}/patients?allergy=Penicillin
###
GET {{mr}}/patients?icd10=I10&unit=MOEMA
###
GET {{mr}}/patients?q=ribeiro

### Full record of patient 1
GET {{mr}}/patients/1

### $addToSet on an embedded array
POST {{mr}}/patients/1/allergies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "substance": "Iodinated contrast", "reaction": "bronchospasm", "severity": "SEVERE" }

### $pull
DELETE {{mr}}/patients/1/allergies/Iodinated contrast

### $push
POST {{mr}}/patients/1/medications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Losartan", "dose": "50mg", "frequency": "once daily" }

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### ENCOUNTERS (Delivery 1 contract, preserved)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Clinical timeline (dominant query: index {patientId:1, occurredAt:-1})
GET {{mr}}/patient/1

### Filters
GET {{mr}}?specialty=Cardiology&size=5
###
GET {{mr}}?type=EXAM&size=5
###
GET {{mr}}?tag=hypertension
###
GET {{mr}}?icd10=E11
###
GET {{mr}}?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-09-30

### A QUERY ONLY THE DOCUMENT MODEL MAKES NATURAL:
### encounters that HAVE a given measurement inside clinicalData.
GET {{mr}}?clinicalDataKey=intraocularPressure
###
GET {{mr}}?clinicalDataKey=cbc.hemoglobin

### New CARDIOLOGY encounter
POST {{mr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "recordType": "CONSULTATION",
  "specialty": "Cardiology",
  "professional": { "name": "Dr. Helio Vasconcelos", "license": "CRM-SP 45871" },
  "occurredAt": "2026-09-01T10:00:00",
  "chiefComplaint": "Follow-up for blood pressure control",
  "diagnosis": [{ "icd10": "I10", "description": "Essential hypertension" }],
  "tags": ["hypertension", "follow-up"],
  "clinicalData": {
    "bloodPressure": { "systolic": 138, "diastolic": 86, "unit": "mmHg" },
    "heartRate": 76,
    "ecg": { "rhythm": "sinus", "findings": [] },
    "ejectionFraction": 61.2
  },
  "prescriptions": [{ "name": "Losartan", "dose": "50mg", "frequency": "once daily", "days": 30 }]
}

### New OPHTHALMOLOGY encounter - completely different structure, same collection
POST {{mr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 2,
  "recordType": "CONSULTATION",
  "specialty": "Ophthalmology",
  "professional": "Dr. Renata Camargo",
  "occurredAt": "2026-09-01T14:00:00",
  "diagnosis": [{ "icd10": "H52.1", "description": "Myopia" }],
  "clinicalData": {
    "visualAcuity": { "rightEye": "20/40", "leftEye": "20/30" },
    "intraocularPressure": { "rightEye": 16, "leftEye": 15, "unit": "mmHg" },
    "refraction": { "rightEye": { "sphere": -2.25, "cylinder": -0.75, "axis": 180 } }
  }
}

### INVALID document: rejected by schema validation (422 with the details)
POST {{mr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": 1, "recordType": "CONSULTATION", "specialty": "Cardiology", "diagnosis": [{ "icd10": "hypertension", "description": "code outside the ICD-10 pattern" }], "clinicalData": {} }

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### ATLAS SEARCH
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Full-text with fuzzy ("diabetis" finds "diabetes") and facets
GET {{mr}}/search?q=diabetis

###
GET {{mr}}/search?q=headaches&specialty=General Practice

### Name autocomplete
GET {{mr}}/search/autocomplete?q=mar

### Search index state
GET {{mr}}/search/status

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### AGGREGATION (dashboard)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Analysis catalog
GET {{mr}}/analytics

### Every dashboard analysis at once
GET {{mr}}/analytics/dashboard

### One analysis, with the pipeline in the response
GET {{mr}}/analytics/topDiagnoses
###
GET {{mr}}/analytics/allergyConflicts
###
GET {{mr}}/analytics/bloodPressureTrend?patientId=1

### How Atlas processed it: explain of the pipeline, per stage
GET {{mr}}/analytics/allergyConflicts/explain

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### GEOSPATIAL
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Patients within 2 km of the Moema unit
GET {{mr}}/geo/near-unit/MOEMA?maxKm=2

### Hypertensive patients within 3 km of any point (Av. Paulista)
GET {{mr}}/geo/near?lng=-46.6560&lat=-23.5614&maxKm=3&icd10=I10

### Coverage by unit
GET {{mr}}/geo/coverage

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### BEHIND THE SCENES
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Explain: same query without index (COLLSCAN) ...
GET {{mr}}/admin/explain?field=patientId&value=7&index=false

### ... and with index (IXSCAN)
GET {{mr}}/admin/explain?field=patientId&value=7&index=true

### Indexes, schema and statistics
GET {{mr}}/admin/indexes
###
GET {{mr}}/admin/schema
###
GET {{mr}}/admin/overview

### Random raw document of a specialty
GET {{mr}}/admin/sample/encounters?specialty=Psychiatry

### Schema validation in action (invalid document, nothing is written)
POST {{mr}}/admin/validation-demo

### Reload the demo data (deletes and recreates)
POST {{mr}}/admin/seed?force=true
